          <span>PESAN SEKARANG &amp; BAYAR DI TEMPAT (COD)</span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] sm:text-[11.5px] text-slate-600 font-medium text-center">
          Bisa COD Seluruh Indonesia • Garansi 100% Produk Original
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 3. SECTION: PAIN & AGITATION (FRUSTRASI SIKAT WC) ═══ -->
    <section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 pt-8 pb-10 text-center">
      <div class="px-5">
        <h2 class="text-[clamp(21px,6.5vw,25px)] font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight leading-[1.22]">
          Capek Menggosok WC Berjam-Jam, Tapi Kerak Kuning Masih Nempel?
