            Bukti Nyata Keran Stainless &amp; Dinding Keramik Kembali Mengkilap Seperti Baru
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Grid Area Pembersihan -->
      <div class="mt-5 px-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-left">
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs">
          <p class="font-extrabold text-sky-900 text-[13px]">Kloset Duduk &amp; Jongkok</p>
          <p class="text-[11.5px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-snug">Menghilangkan lingkaran noda kuning dan kerak air di dasar kloset.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs">
          <p class="font-extrabold text-sky-900 text-[13px]">Keran Stainless &amp; Shower</p>
          <p class="text-[11.5px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-snug">Rontokkan bercak air putih berkerak (water spots) tanpa mengikis chrome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs">
          <p class="font-extrabold text-sky-900 text-[13px]">Wastafel &amp; Meja Keramik</p>
