    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 6. SECTION: HASIL NYATA BEFORE-AFTER ═══ -->
    <section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white pt-8 pb-10 text-center">
      <div class="px-5">
        <h2 class="text-[clamp(21px,6.5vw,25px)] font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight leading-[1.22]">
          Hasil Nyata: Noda Langsung Lenyap
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-[13.5px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-[420px] mx-auto text-center mb-6">
          Lihat perbandingan langsung sebelum dan sesudah penggunaan GlowHome Foam Cleaner:
        </p>
